# game mode
# Bazzite's Steam Game Mode session does not survive this image: Terra (enabled in
# build.sh) ships terra-gamescope, which Conflicts: gamescope, so dnf swaps out the
# base image's gamescope and drops gamescope-session-plus with it. Pull the session
# back in explicitly. terra-gamescope Provides: gamescope, so it satisfies the dep
# without reintroducing the conflict.
#   gamescope-session       -> /usr/bin/gamescope-session-plus + the user units
#   gamescope-session-steam -> the wayland-session entry and the sessions.d/steam
#                              defaults that punktfunk's own drop-in at
#                              /etc/gamescope-session-plus/sessions.d/steam overrides
#                              to fall back to the headless backend on a box with no
#                              display connected
gamescope-session
gamescope-session-steam

